## Validation recorded for implementation commit `c091d507`

Environment: macOS 26.6.1 aarch64, Rust/Cargo 1.85.0, Maven 3.10.0, Java 27.

- Protocol all-feature tests: PASS (131 unit tests, header inventory and
  validation, 47 doctests).
- Remoting query/admin decode-mode fixture test: PASS.
- Core `admin_rpc`: PASS (25 tests).
- Strict all-target/all-feature Clippy for Protocol, Remoting, and Core: PASS.
- Maven `verify`: PASS (37 scenarios, fixture checks, 59 typed-header and 14
  typed-body cross-decodes).
- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` and `git diff --check`: PASS.

The first standalone Rust typed-header fixture-generator attempt ran before
the Java header fixture output for request code 300 had been generated and
failed because the oracle input was absent. The order was corrected: generate
the Java fixture first, then run the Rust typed-header generator; Maven
`verify` subsequently passed its Java fixture, Rust cross-decode, and drift
checks.

